  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "阿母ê青矸仔水"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>林淑美</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「米--à，he青矸仔ê花露水買有--無？若無，紙kheh仔ê puì仔粉bóng sám mā好--lah！Ài註明尪仔有穿裙--ê hannh！」電話hit頭，母--à三叮嚀四huan咐，驚我買m̄-tio̍h--去。便若熱--人beh到，阿母就先注文起來囥。尤其前一站仔風聲講工廠無beh生產--ah，害伊sī-suā làu阮tsit陣niau-lô sì-kè去店仔bāu tńg來囤。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">講著tsit味，自細漢鼻到tann iáu是kài迷人。熱--人天氣tshiah-ia̍h，阿母ē tī面桶sîn寡水koh幾滴仔青矸仔水。半晡仔阮sńg kah規身軀黏thi-thi，伊若tī門口埕huah一聲，規陣囡仔就知影beh tńg去洗手面兼揉身軀--ah！身軀揉好芳芳koh輕鬆，親像食暗頓進前ê重要儀式。青春期ê時，小弟ê頭毛油káu-hián khah重，阿母ē教伊倒寡踮手蹄仔，sī緊tī拄洗好iáu leh滴水ê頭殼心挲挲lua̍h-lua̍h--leh，he就親像一港冷氣tuì頭殼灌--入-去，規个人清爽kah！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">若頷仔頸生puì仔jiàu kah紅kòng-kòng，就知害--ah。母--à tsiok粗殘--ê，直接kā阮掠來gia̍p leh伊ê大腿邊，正手大拇公kā矸仔喙hân--leh，倒入去倒手手蹄仔內，suà手「pha」一聲tuì頷仔頸過，阿娘uê！也鹽、也疼、也爽，阿母雙跤一下開，我早就hōo鹽kah身軀ná tiô，目屎拖leh輾--ah，ná行ná罵。講mā奇怪，隔tńg工起--來頷仔頸ê puì仔suah無影無跡，koh有芳芳粉粉ê感覺neh！大漢tsiah知，原來青矸仔水有酒精ê成份，莫怪細漢hōo鹽kah哀m̄敢，不而過iáu是真kah意伊ê清芳味。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit-má換我huānn家，厝內食穿、開銷，一sián五厘lóng ài斟酌拍算。5月天火燒埔，厝--裡hannh kah ná火爐！囡仔細漢bē堪得熱，beh擋kah 32度tsiah開冷氣，眠床頂ê大甲草蓆，tio̍h-ài先用青矸仔水透水--過ê面布拭拭--leh，tsiah ē ta鬆好安眠；賰--ê留落來揉塗跤降溫度koh清氣；揉塗跤ê水提來tshiâng便所koh順suà teh臭尿破味。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我tī學校上班無冷氣，tiānn-tiānn hōo南國熱情ê日頭hannh kah規身軀臭汗酸味。Tshiâng-tsāi ná講課，汗水就滴tuì塗跤底，人mā kiōng-beh lian--去。中晝歇睏ê時，面巾滴兩滴仔阿母上愛ê青矸仔水kā身軀揉揉--leh，規个人lóng精神--起-來，kā下晡beh上課ê khuì力tshuân hōo便，我靠--ê就是阿母ê青矸仔水。你kám有鼻著伊ê清芳味？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a name='more'></a></span><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgQsVC-0p1HOwRuH42W73hdBDoerO2zS_LLtkDuo-x0AYjX81xYrVT8iX72C5i6zO6n6jDGth8EghNcS9UniFCRsp_BbcLmh04bgbsEFbnwDmnD8ekhzkoWXREYKV6Sfpj8IpBSMWkvBR246uO_jldyLisRspG1KHLWdLdmTxQE-CgIt2uwV8bngUAIcg/s2847/339%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2847\" data-original-width=\"2000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgQsVC-0p1HOwRuH42W73hdBDoerO2zS_LLtkDuo-x0AYjX81xYrVT8iX72C5i6zO6n6jDGth8EghNcS9UniFCRsp_BbcLmh04bgbsEFbnwDmnD8ekhzkoWXREYKV6Sfpj8IpBSMWkvBR246uO_jldyLisRspG1KHLWdLdmTxQE-CgIt2uwV8bngUAIcg/w450-h640/339%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjvnn_gOvJzuNJTiLqemIQZvx38aqKXysOUY3WlpKGsSJamcw2yldAS8GWWcB98aazQ0qUlsu6E2uK3ct_9zyEiERtGkJpTnIae80Hff894UB0Ma4CvIgYJI2n-3cRjUa2iFhCgW-_EwCaY42EnJeSfds8Yfi7S21iBBcObLOJq_0gr_CqFacrq7Z2euA/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1339%E6%9C%9F_22.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29